  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 505.01 EAP Distribution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 505.01 EAP Distribution. Upon receiving department approval of the draft EAP pursuant to Env-Wr 504.01, the owner shall distribute the approved EAP to persons and entities, as identified in Env-Wr 504.09.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 506.01)",
